# Build context is the repository root for both images (app/Dockerfile, worker/Dockerfile).
# SECURITY: secrets and infrastructure must never enter a build context. `az acr build` uploads the whole
# context to Azure, and a careless COPY would bake files into an image.
infra/
**/.secrets/
scratch
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.env

# Build outputs, dependencies and tooling state.
.git/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
artifacts/
app/backend/wwwroot/
**/TestResults/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/coverage/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.tsbuildinfo
